      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate feature request, formerly requested:\n\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/world-filter-for-user-rank\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/trust-level-public-instances",
